":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Famous cosplayer-turned-mom."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Reiji's mother. Nayuta used to be a famous cosplay model, but withdrew from the scene after meeting her husband. Following the birth of her children, she chose to become a fashion designer instead - she also later had a hand in the costume designs for her husband's best-selling manga."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a mother, Nayuta certainly has her quirks. She's easy-going, but ends up relying on her younger sister Ena to do all the chores. Despite her aversion to housework, though, she's an extremely skilled seamstress, and most of her costumes take barely a day to make."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From English Official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64341"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元カリスマレイヤーだったが、旦那と出会い引退。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供を授かり、それを機にデザイナーの道へ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在も旦那の漫画の衣装デザインを手がけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エキセントリックで自由な母親。家事力は低い。全て妹の恵那にさせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、裁縫の腕は高く、だいたいの衣装なら一晩で作れる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19372","sourceWorkId":"25866","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元カリスマレイヤーだったが、旦那と出会い引退。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供を授かり、それを機にデザイナーの道へ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在も旦那の漫画の衣装デザインを手がけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エキセントリックで自由な母親。家事力は低い。全て妹の恵那にさせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、裁縫の腕は高く、だいたいの衣装なら一晩で作れる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"57869"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19372","sourceWorkId":"25866","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19372","sourceWorkId":"25866","source